  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Payment in respect of Ireland&apos;s membership of the African development Bank (2nd instalment of eight to be made from 2020-2028); and   Ireland&apos;s particiaption in the seventh General Capital increase of the Bank Group (GCI VII). 1st instalment of eight to be made from 2021-2028.  The objective of the Bank is to promote sustainable economic development and social progress in its regional member countries (RMCs), thus contributing to poverty reduction.</narrative>
